H. <NOTE N="58" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1361" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1361"></COL> Ardwinus 3.</NOTE>  Ratisbonensis <NOTE N="59" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1361" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1361"></COL> radisboniensis
