2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">V. II.</HI></NOTE>  Spirensis episcopus <NOTE N="62" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1361" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1361"></COL> episcopus et alie multe ecclesiastice persone ac seculares 3.  <HI REND="ITALIC">reliqua desunt.</HI></NOTE> . H. <NOTE N="63" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1361" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1361"></COL> A.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">V. II.</HI></NOTE> 
Augustensis episcopus. G. <NOTE N="64" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1361" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1361"></COL> Godebaldus  <HI REND="ITALIC">G.</HI></NOTE>  Trajectensis <NOTE N="65" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1361" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1361"></COL> tragectensis 2.</NOTE>  episcopus
